12\" height=\"161\" />\n      <text id=\"4:131\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 10 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"378d9e2a-4a5b-4a6d-8566-b937897a04c2"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_278e2e12","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
