ns:\" + \"Red Quinoa, Lime, Honey, Blueberries, Strawberries, Mango, Fresh mint.\"\n- Body: \"If you are looking for a new fruit salad to eat today, quinoa is the perfect brunch for you.\"\n- \"Add to basket\" button\nLinks: Go back → 04, Add to basket → 06.\n\n**06_Basket**:\n- Header: orange band with Go back + \"My Basket\" title\n- List of 3 items: each with photo (in rounded tinted square), name, \"2 packs\", ₦20,000\n- Total row: \"Total\" + ₦60,000\n- Checkout button\nLinks: Go back → 04, Checkout → 07.\n\n**07_Checkout_Delivery**: sheet over basket\n- Dimmed basket behind (I'll draw a semi-transparent overlay over a simplified basket backdrop — actually since \"one frame each\", the frame contains the basket behind + sheet. I can build the basket content simplified or reuse. Simplest: draw the basket screen content (a lighter simplified version) then overlay dark rgba + sheet on top.)\n- Sheet: white rounded top corners, close button, \"Delivery address\" field filled \"10th avenue, Lekki, Lagos State\", \"Number we can call\" filled \"09090605708\", \"Pay on delivery\" (secondary/outline) and \"Pay with card\" (primary) buttons.\n\n**08_Checkout_Card**: sheet over basket\n- Sheet with close, \"Card Holder's Name\" Tony Chris, \"Card Number\" 1234 5678 9012 1314, row: \"Date\" 10/30 + \"CVV\" 123, \"Complete Order\" button.\n\n**09_Order_Complete**: \n- Icon_Success_Check, \"Congratulations!!!\", \"Your order has been taken and is being attended to\", \"Track order\" (primary), \"Continue shopping\" (secondary/outline).\n\n**10_Track_Order**:\n- Header: Go back + \"Delivery Status\"\n- Map_Delivery image with call the delivery agent (Icon_Call) action\n- Steps list: Order Taken (done, Step_Order_Taken icon, Icon_Step_Done), Order Is Being Prepared (done, Step_Order_Prepared), Order Is Being Delivered (current, Step_Order_Delivering, \"Your delivery agent is coming\"), Order Received (pending)\n- Status presentation: done = check icon / orange; current = high