's a component in the same file. These are on a different page but same file, fine.\n\n**Layout coordinates** — I'll compute carefully as I write scripts.\n\nLet me define positions: screens laid out in a grid on workspace page:\nRow 1: 01_Splash (0,0), 02_Welcome (455,0), 03_Name (910,0), 04_Home (1365,0)\nRow 2: 05 (0,892), 06 (455,892), 07 (910,892), 08 (1365,892)\nRow 3: 09 (0,1784), 10 (455,1784)\nComponents area: x from 910.. y 1784+ or a separate area at x=0,y=2600.\n\nActually components on the same page is fine — put them at x 0..800, y 2600 area, named \"· Components\".\n\nLet me now write Script 1: setup page, load fonts, clone 4 given components, create extra components:\n\nComponents to create (each as COMPONENT on workspace):\n1. `Button / Primary` — cloned from 3:25 (327×56, orange, radius 10, Nunito SemiBold 16 white)\n2. `Button / Outline` — white fill, orange stroke 1.5, orange text. 327×56.\n3. `Text Field` — cloned from 3:28.\n4. `Category Tab` — text only; active state I'll handle with two components: `Category Tab / Active` (orange text + underline bar) and `Category Tab / Inactive` (gray text).\n5. `Search Bar` — 327? width: search field with icon + placeholder; plus separate filter button. Make \"Search Bar\" component (gray bg #F5F5F5? use #F3F1F1 radius 10, search icon left, placeholder text) and \"Filter Button\" (orange-ish tint square with Icon_Filter).\n6. `Product Card / Hottest` — 152×~176: photo on tinted rounded top, name, price, add button, heart. Actually original Fruit Hub hottest cards: 152 wide, photo 80px on #FFFAEB bg rounded, name 14, price with naira + add circle. Recommended: 288? No — original recommended cards are big (height 128?) Hmm. I'll design my own:\n   - Hottest card: 152×180 white card radius 16, subtle shadow, photo 84×84 centered top on tinted circle/bg, heart top-right, name 14 SemiBold dark, price 14 Bold orange + Icon_Add bottom-right.\n   - Recommended card: 158×180 similar but different photo bg. Or make 