of workspace page, named exactly: 01_Splash, 02_Welcome, 03_Name, 04_Home, 05_Product_Quinoa, 06_Basket, 07_Checkout_Delivery, 08_Checkout_Card, 09_Order_Complete, 10_Track_Order.\n\nLet me write Script A.\n\nOne more thing: the workspace page id 9:2. When appending top-level frames, positions absolute on canvas. Good.\n\nLet me also double-check Text Field instance text override: instance children — find first child of type TEXT, set fontName (already set) + characters + fills. For instance child text, setting characters is allowed.\n\nFor Button instances, override label text similarly.\n\nLet me start.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"32e1e789-097d-46fb-a2c9-6411f0d5873d","uuid":"e4452c8a-5fd9-4ea7-aecf-a790c6b764f8","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:47:39.493Z","thinking_duration_ms":323495}
