adius 10, shadow; children: image area 150x88, name text 14 SemiBold dark at (12,96), price 14 SemiBold #FFA451 with ₦ glyph at (12,120) — price as text \"₦2,000\"? Brief says prices use Naira glyph (Icon_Naira or \"₦\"). Text glyph is allowed. I'll use text \"₦\". Add button instance (24) at bottom-right (114,124); favourite instance (32) at top-right.\n\nComponent sizing: width 150, height 160.\n\n4. FH / Hottest Card (185x200): white bg radius 10 shadow, image 161x113 top, name, price left, heart bottom.\n\nActually the classic kit \"Hottest\" cards: 158 wide? I'll do 185.\n\nHmm, keep it manageable: One Product Card component reused in both Hottest row (horizontal scroll) and Recommended grid, sized 150x160 default. Instances can be resized.\n\n5. FH / Basket Row (327x64): white bg radius 10, subtle shadow; image 64x64 left with field bg; name 16 SemiBold; \"2 packs\" 12 secondary; price right \"₦20,000\" 14 SemiBold orange.\n\n6. FH / Qty Stepper: minus (32) - qty text - plus (32). Use Icon_Minus/Icon_Plus clones.\n\n7. FH / Header Back: 40x44 white bg rounded rect radius 10 with Icon_Back centered + optional title? Product screen has \"Go back\" button: classic kit has back arrow in white rounded square. I'll make FH / IconButton Back 44x44: white bg, radius 10, shadow? subtle.\n\n8. FH / Chip (category tab): height 32, padding 16; component with selected state? I'll make two components: \"FH / Chip / Selected\" (primary fill, white text 14 SemiBold) and \"FH / Chip / Default\" (transparent, secondary text). Or a single component set. Simpler: two components.\n\n9. FH / Step Row (track order): 56 icon + title + status. Component: icon left in 56x56 tinted rounded square, title 16 SemiBold, subtitle. Status check Icon_Step_Done at right for done; for current show \"Your delivery agent is coming\" + call button; pending grey.\n\nSimplify: Step Row component 327x72: icon slot (instance of step icon), title, right status icon (done check / pending dot). Instances customized per step.\n\n10. FH / IconButton Call: 40x40 primary circle with Icon_Call white? Icon_Call clone recolor to white on primary circle.\n\n11. FH / Success Mark: 120x120 tint circle with Icon_Success_Check 42 center.\n\n12. FH / Bottom Sheet: white, radius 24 top corners, height varies. Component 375x h. With handle? I'll build sheets as frames within screens instead of components, but brief says \"the sheets ... as reusable components\". I'll make a \"FH / Sheet\" component: 375 wide, top radius 24, white, subtle shadow, close button row (Icon_Close) and title. Then instances resized with content laid on top... Not really nestable. Better approach: sheet component contains: bg, drag handle, close button, title text. Screen content (fields, buttons) placed as siblings inside the screen frame on top of the sheet instance. That's acceptable reuse.\n\nText styles: create text styles via figma.createTextStyle? Optional but nice for consistency. Quick: Heading/L, Heading/M, Body, Caption. I'll create 5 text styles.\n\nThis is getting large; split into calls:\n- Call 3a: clone media components, return ids map.\n- Call 3b: create custom components.\nThen screens.\n\nCall 3a now.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"32e1e789-097d-46fb-a2c9-6411f0d5873d","uuid":"97d3da88-2690-4adc-869e-6ade5153ac7f","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:48:34.568Z","thinking_duration_ms":38079}
